{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/south-ridge-emaar-properties-downtown-dubai","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":341,"crm_id":"2074","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"South Ridge","slug":"south-ridge-emaar-properties-downtown-dubai","display_address":"Downtown Dubai","building_type":["apartment","penthouse","villa"],"completion_year":"Ready","developer":"Emaar Properties","price":8013888,"display_price":"8.01M","lattitude":25.1870814,"longitude":55.2773708,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":6,"display_bedrooms":"1,2,3,4,6","about":"<p>South Ridge is a project by Emaar located in the heart of Dubai's Downtown area. It offers <strong>1-4 bedroom apartments</strong>, <strong>six-bedroom penthouses and villas</strong>. The complex consists of six towers from 30 to 44 floors, united by a podium, including a variety of amenities and facilities. The design of the buildings is characterized by fully glazed sections of upward facing walls. Art Deco style with blue tinted glass is present on each of the towers.</p><p>South Ridge Towers provides its residents with a complete lifestyle with all the necessary amenities including: a spacious gym for sports activities, children's playroom, indoor and outdoor swimming pools, modern conference room for business events, badminton court. There is also a parking lot for residents and a café with a varied menu.</p><p>The location of the complex allows you to quickly get to many attractions of the city. Famous places such as Dubai Opera, DIFC, Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall are nearby. These are only a 6-minute drive away. In addition, the Business Bay business district is just 10 minutes away by car, meaning residents can quickly get to important business meetings and events without spending a lot of time on the road. Dubai International Airport is also a 13-minute drive away, providing convenience and comfort for travelers.</p><p>South Ridge is an ideal choice for those who appreciate comfort and are looking for a modern lifestyle in the heart of Dubai.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2074/images/2024/06/18/CEV8fvVd0MsGqIeySaC5W6rtJCjSi98Y8dkhqgfr.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/18/CEV8fvVd0MsGqIeySaC5W6rtJCjSi98Y8dkhqgfr.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2074/images/2024/06/18/wr61ZT9petGhZpzfqK6uXH4Bw02pAwXmvFXrGTBl.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/18/wr61ZT9petGhZpzfqK6uXH4Bw02pAwXmvFXrGTBl.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2074/images/2024/06/18/JQU1HOeOqnKbppkJRleCQQrVNcJXxxOaRoaGD9A3.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/18/JQU1HOeOqnKbppkJRleCQQrVNcJXxxOaRoaGD9A3.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2296,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1534,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1564,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1565,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1566,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1567,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"4 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1568,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"6 Be